      <Desc>RETAIL OPERATIONS OF RECYCLED COMPUTERS TO LOW INCOME FAMILIES AND CHARITABLE ORGANIZATIONS DONATED FOR THE COST OF REFURBISHING. THE COMMUNITY TECHNOLOGY CENTER PROVIDES TECHNOLOGY INFORMATION AND COMPUTERS FOR THE LOW COST OF REFURBISHING, AS WELL AS REPAIR AND WARRANTY SERVICES TO QUALIFIED COMMUNITY MEMBERS. SALVAGE PROGRAM RECYCLES COMPUTERS AND ELECTRONIC EQUIPMENT IN AN ECO-FRIENDLY MANNER.SINCE INCEPTION, THE ORGANIZATION HAS PROVIDED MORE THAN 64,288 COMPUTERS TO SAN DIEGO CHARITABLE ORGANIZATIONS AND INDIVIDUALS. THESE CONSIST OF DONATED EQUIPMENT THAT HAS BEEN REFURBISHED AND UPDATED.</Desc>
