        <RevenueAmt>222380</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>DIGITAL LITERACY PROGRAMS INCLUDE IN-PERSON AND HYBRID TRAINING AT OUR LOCATION OR AT PARTNER LOCATIONS THROUGHOUT THE COUNTY OF SAN DIEGO, WITH THE INTENTION OF SUPPORTING THOSE WHO NEED HELP CONNECTING TO TECHNOLOGY FROM BASIC TO MORE ADVANCED LEVELS. THIS INCLUDES ADAPTIVE TECHNOLOGY, WHICH TRAINS INDIVIDUALS WHO ARE BLIND OR NEAR-BLIND TO USE COMPUTERS.</Desc>
